{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","海葬之潮"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","海葬の潮"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","敌人受到控制效果后会进入“溺水”，“溺水”的敌人受到的伤害提升；涅尔瓦释放大招后提升攻击力和攻击速度，普通攻击可以在“溺水”的敌人间弹射。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","行動阻害効果を受けた敵に「水難」マークを付与。「水難」マークを持つ敵は被ダメージUP。必殺技発動後、自身の攻撃力と攻撃速度がUPし、通常攻撃に「海流」効果を付与、「海流」は「水難」を持つ敵の間でバウンドする"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，每名敌人累计受到6秒的控制状态时，对该名敌人施加“溺水”：造成350% + 35% ATK伤害，涅尔瓦对处于“溺水”的敌人造成的伤害增加30%，直到战斗结束。对伤害类型为魔法的敌人，施加“溺水”所需的控制时长缩短至4秒。\n主动使用时，涅尔瓦使用潮汐之力增强自身12秒。潮汐之力持续时间内涅尔瓦提升22%攻击力和60 + 8点攻击速度，同时使自身的普通攻击额外携带“潮涌”效果：命中时会向“溺水”的敌人依次弹射“潮涌”造成额外220% + 30% ATK伤害，每个角色最多被弹射1次。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：行動阻害効果を累計6秒以上受けた敵に「水難」マークを永続的に付与：350% + 35% ATKのダメージを与える。ネルヴァが「水難」マークを持つ敵に与えるダメージ+30%。対象の敵のダメージタイプが「魔法」の場合、「水難」マーク付与に必要な行動阻害効果の時間が4秒に短縮される\nアクティブ効果：「海の力」で自身を12秒間強化。その間、自身の攻撃力+22%、攻撃速度+60 + 8、通常攻撃に「海流」効果を付与。「海流」効果：通常攻撃ヒット時、「水難」を持つ敵に「海流」をバウンドさせ、220% + 30% ATKの追加ダメージを与える。敵1体につき、最大1回までバウンド可能"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":161,"end":165,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"},{"start":220,"end":226,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":44,"end":50,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":192,"end":196,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"},{"start":253,"end":259,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":216,"end":230,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":40,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":249,"end":263,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","潮汐之力持续时间内的攻击力提升至24%，“潮涌”造成的额外伤害提升至240% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「海の力」による攻撃力上昇量が24%にUP。「海流」による追加ダメージが240% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":40,"end":46,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":36,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","潮汐之力持续时间内的攻击力提升至26%，“潮涌”造成的额外伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","「海の力」による攻撃力上昇量が26%にUP。「海流」による追加ダメージが260% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":40,"end":46,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":36,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","潮汐之力持续时间内的攻击力提升至28%，“潮涌”造成的额外伤害提升至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","「海の力」による攻撃力上昇量が28%にUP。「海流」による追加ダメージが280% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":40,"end":46,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":36,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","潮汐之力持续时间内的攻击力提升至30%，“潮涌”造成的额外伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","「海の力」による攻撃力上昇量が30%にUP。「海流」による追加ダメージが300% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":40,"end":46,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":36,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","溯魂脊刺"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","魂の刺突"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","每隔若干次普攻得到强化：命中时击退敌人，造成额外伤害并眩晕。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","通常攻撃を数回行うごとに、次の通常攻撃を強化：ダメージがUPし、ヒットした敵を後退させ、スタンを付与"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每进行3次普通攻击后，涅尔瓦的下一次普通攻击会得到增强：在命中敌人后会击退敌人{KnockBack}格，造成270% + 30% ATK伤害并使其眩晕持续2秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","通常攻撃を3回行うごとに、次の通常攻撃を強化：敵に270% + 30% ATKのダメージを与え、{KnockBack}マス後退させ、2秒間のスタンを付与"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":58,"end":64,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":54,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが300% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"star